TITLE Define a Simple Groundwater Sample

SOLUTION 1 Groundwater Example
    units   mg/L
    temp    25.0    # Temperature in celsius
    pH      7.5
    pe      4.0     # Redox potential

    # Elemental concentrations
    Ca      80.0
    Mg      20.0
    Na      45.0
    Cl      90.0
    C(4)    200.0 as HCO3   # Carbonate species reported as bicarbonate

END